tColor'/><text x='157.8' y='193.2' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='215.0' y1='176.2' x2='215.0' y2='182.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='212.0' y='193.2' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='269.2' y1='176.2' x2='269.2' y2='182.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='266.2' y='193.2' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='49.5' y1='144.6' x2='55.5' y2='144.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='36.5' y='148.6' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='49.5' y1='110.0' x2='55.5' y2='110.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='36.5' y='114.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='49.5' y1='75.4' x2='55.5' y2='75.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='36.5' y='79.4' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='49.5' y1='40.8' x2='55.5' y2='40.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='36.5' y='44.8' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Entre 0 y 3, \\(f\\) queda por encima (en \\(x=1\\): \\(\\sqrt3\\gt\\frac13\\)):</p>\\[A=\\int_0^3\\left(\\sqrt3\\,x^{1/2}-\\frac{x^2}3\\right)dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{2\\sqrt3}3x^{3/2}-\\frac{x^3}9\\Bigr]_0^3=\\frac{2\\sqrt3}3\\cdot3\\sqrt3-3=6-3=3\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=3\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":"a, b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-4-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dado el sistema de ecuaciones lineales \\[\\begin{cases}x+\\lambda y+z=4\\\\x+3y+z=5\\\\\\lambda x+y+z=4\\end{cases}\\]","apartados":["(1,75 p.) Discútelo según los valores del parámetro \\(\\lambda\\).","(0,75 p.) Resuélvelo en el caso \\(\\lambda=1\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&\\lambda&1&4\\\\1&3&1&5\\\\\\lambda&1&1&4\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&\\lambda&1\\\\1&3&1\\\\\\lambda&1&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(3+\\lambda^{2}+1\\bigr)-\\bigl(3 \\lambda+1+\\lambda\\bigr)\\]\\[=\\lambda^2-4\\lambda+3=(\\lambda-1)(\\lambda-3)\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda\\neq1,3\\)<b>:</b> compatible determinado.</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=3\\)<b>:</b> las dos primeras ecuaciones son \\(x+3y+z=4\\) y \\(x+3y+z=5\\): <b>incompatible</b>.</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\lambda=1\\)<b>:</b> la 1.ª y la 3.ª ecuaciones son iguales (\\(x+y+z=4\\)) y \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\1&3\\end{vmatrix}=2\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\). <b>Compatible indeterminado.</b></p><div class='res'>Si \\(\\lambda\\neq1,3\\): compatible determinado. Si \\(\\lambda=1\\): compatible indeterminado. Si \\(\\lambda=3\\): incompatible</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(x+y+z=4\\), \\(x+3y+z=5\\). </p><p>Doy a la incógnita \\(z\\) el valor \\(z=t\\) y lo paso al segundo miembro<i class='n' data-t='why'>La incógnita que no está en el menor no nulo pasa al segundo miembro como parámetro; así queda un sistema con tantas ecuaciones como incógnitas y determinante distinto de 0, que se resuelve por Cramer.</i>:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}x+y=4 - t\\\\x+3y=5 - t\\end{cases}\\]<p>Lo resuelvo por la regla de Cramer<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Cramer: si \\(|A|\\neq0\\), cada incógnita es el cociente entre el determinante que resulta de sustituir su columna por la de los términos independientes y el determinante \\(|A|\\) de la matriz de coeficientes.</i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\1&3\\end{vmatrix}=2\\]\\[x=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}4 - t&1\\\\5 - t&3\\end{vmatrix}}{2}=\\frac{7 - 2 t}{2}=\\frac{7}{2} - t\\]\\[y=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1&4 - t\\\\1&5 - t\\end{vmatrix}}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}\\]<div class='res'>\\(x=\\dfrac72-t,\\ y=\\dfrac12,\\ z=t\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"disc","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"res","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-4-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera el plano \\(\\pi\\) de ecuación \\(3x-2y-2z=7\\) y la recta \\(r\\) definida por \\(\\dfrac{x-2}2=\\dfrac{y+1}1=\\dfrac{z-2}2\\).","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Determina la ecuación del plano paralelo a \\(\\pi\\) que contiene a \\(r\\).","(1,25 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano ortogonal a \\(\\pi\\) que contiene a \\(r\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(2,-1,2)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(2,1,2)\\); la normal de \\(\\pi\\) es \\(\\vec n=(3,-2,-2)\\), y \\(\\vec d\\cdot\\vec n=6-2-4=0\\): \\(r\\) es paralela a \\(\\pi\\) (si no, no existiría el plano pedido).</p><p>El plano paralelo es de la forma \\(3x-2y-2z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(R\\): \\(6+2-4+D=0\\iff D=-4\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(3x-2y-2z-4=0\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>El plano contiene las direcciones \\(\\vec d\\) (de \\(r\\)) y \\(\\vec n\\) (perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\)):</p>\\[\\vec d\\times\\vec n=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\2&1&2\\\\3&-2&-2\\end{vmatrix}=(2,\\,10,\\,-7)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(2x+10y-7z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(R\\): \\(4-10-14+D=0\\iff D=20\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-60,\"el\":8,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-0.4,-2.2,-0.4],[4.4,0.2,4.4],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[4.4,0.2,4.4],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"poly\",[[4.287,0.169,4.262],[1.801,-3.561,4.262],[-0.287,-2.169,-0.262],[2.199,1.561,-0.262]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-0.287,-2.169,-0.262],\"π₁\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"poly\",[[1.921,0.647,4.33],[5.975,-0.164,4.33],[5.348,-3.3,-0.33],[1.294,-2.49,-0.33]],\"rgba(22,163,74,.18)\",\"#16a34a\"],[\"txt\",[5.348,-3.3,-0.33],\"π₂\",\"#16a34a\",4,0],[\"pt\",[2,-1,2],\"R\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m09r4b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m09r4b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m09r4b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m09r4b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='26.0' y1='226.2' x2='255.2' y2='24.7' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='261.2' y='24.7' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><polygon points='250.4,30.4 78.4,42.2 30.8,220.5 202.8,208.7' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='34.8' y='220.5' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π₁</text><polygon points='172.9,18.0 305.8,34.3 215.5,246.0 82.6,229.7' fill='rgba(22,163,74,.18)' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='219.5' y='246.0' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π₂</text><circle cx='140.6' cy='125.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='147.6' y='119.4' font-weight='700'>R</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='37.9' y2='271.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='39.7' y='275.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='32.0' y2='268.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='31.8' y='271.4' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='252.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(2x+10y-7z+20=0\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"ecs","apartados":"a, b"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"pos","apartados":"a"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"}]}